    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323">

                <pb facs="0492" n="178" xml:id="pg178"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Guthrie</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >and the Chargé d’Affaires in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-12T15:00:00-05:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">September 12, 1914, 3 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Ascertain and report as to truth of statements made in English press that
                    Japanese Government proposes to extend war to regions east of Hwang-ho River and
                    expel all Germans not only from Dalny but from Mukden, Changchun, and even
                    Tientsin.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
